{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131970/extras/4bd3049e1688de4c943191e16341a3de.avif?t=1762531946\" width=1523 height=805 /></span>L's In Eggs is a first-person single-player game where the player must collect eggs and navigate platforms by jumping on them or using any other available means. You use resources such as a flashlight to see through dark areas, drink water to heal, and correctly jump over obstacles or survive them without taking damage. You can attack and defend using your hands or passive objects. You can only play with a mouse and keyboard; console controls are not supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to survive the platforms and collect items like eggs to earn rewards. Currently, there is no skill tree, but it will be available at launch and in future demo updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some parts of the environment have music, but for the most part, the game only features ambient sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's story is still under development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully dubbed and subtitled in Brazilian Portuguese, with the interface currently only in English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in early development and this demo is a preview of what the game will be like. Currently, there are no enemies, as the game is being developed by a single person, Lucas Jardeu. He's having trouble implementing some mechanics, so the enemies have been temporarily removed. But watch out for Lucy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun and we hope you laugh while playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently incomplete; it's in an (demo) presentation version where the subtitles and voice acting are only in Portuguese, and the interface is only in English. Changing the language within the game is not currently available.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131970/extras/c1e8aab2d0af96045e2277c18d2afc26.avif?t=1762531946\" width=1508 height=822 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131970?t=1762531946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131970/ee426f138abbb8ef61ec08dc11402b4a4dc01926/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762531946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131970/bf9e224c67f46a95b729a647d62a3841a3f9c67c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762531946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131970/bf9e224c67f46a95b729a647d62a3841a3f9c67c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762531946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game does not contain adult content. Sexually suggestive language may appear in mild forms. The game also does not contain the use of chemicals, alcohol, or drugs."},"demos":[{"appid":4132000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131970/extras/4bd3049e1688de4c943191e16341a3de.avif?t=1762531946\" width=1523 height=805 /></span>L's In Eggs is a first-person single-player game where the player must collect eggs and navigate platforms by jumping on them or using any other available means. You use resources such as a flashlight to see through dark areas, drink water to heal, and correctly jump over obstacles or survive them without taking damage. You can attack and defend using your hands or passive objects. You can only play with a mouse and keyboard; console controls are not supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to survive the platforms and collect items like eggs to earn rewards. Currently, there is no skill tree, but it will be available at launch and in future demo updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some parts of the environment have music, but for the most part, the game only features ambient sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's story is still under development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully dubbed and subtitled in Brazilian Portuguese, with the interface currently only in English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in early development and this demo is a preview of what the game will be like. Currently, there are no enemies, as the game is being developed by a single person, Lucas Jardeu. He's having trouble implementing some mechanics, so the enemies have been temporarily removed. But watch out for Lucy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun and we hope you laugh while playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently incomplete; it's in an (demo) presentation version where the subtitles and voice acting are only in Portuguese, and the interface is only in English. Changing the language within the game is not currently available.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131970/extras/c1e8aab2d0af96045e2277c18d2afc26.avif?t=1762531946\" width=1508 height=822 /></span></p>","developers":["Lucas Jardeu"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131970/97998a62e5771ed4900e02ec99520cb4a10b832c/header.jpg?t=1762531946","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u